  playerCoins: {fileID: 813193505}
  lines:
  - Greetings, adventurer. If you ever forget what quest you're on, simply press
    the "ESC" key to bring up your quest log.
  - It will help keep you on track and remind you of your objectives.
  - 'Speaking of quests, I have one for you if you''re interested. I need you to
    collect 25 coins for me. They can be found scattered throughout this land, so
    keep your eyes open.  '
  - 'If you succeed, I will reward you with a powerful weapon that will aid you in
    your future battles. Good luck, adventurer.    '
